        "quote": "(a) The Utilities Director is authorized to establish local limits pursuant to 40 CFR Section 403.5(c) . The Director shall administratively establish local limits for those pollutants that may cause a pass-through or interference.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.300:block:0#text",
